{%- comment -%}
  Card variant 5/5 (sections/5dla_collection-product-grid.liquid's
  `product_card_type` setting picks between 5dla_product-card-1/2/3/4/5).
  Ported 1:1 (markup + CSS) from the reference's `article.compare-product-card`
  inside `section#collection` (html/revamp-collection/rendered/Fusion TEMPO!
  Wind-Tunnel Performance & Pro Racing _ 5DLA.html).

  `c5dla-card-5` on the root element is this variant's CSS prefix (see
  client/ver_2_0/scss/collection/_product-card-5.scss), same convention as
  card 1/2/3/4.

  Font: Jost - inherited from the scope-wide `:root` rule in
  collection.scss (self-hosted from client/ver_2_0/fonts/Jost/static), not
  re-declared here, same convention as card 2/3/4.

  Data mapping (per request, .compare-product-copy element only):
  - p: product.vendor.
  - h3: product.title.
  - span (price, inside the bottom row): current_variant.price.
  - a (all anchors - image link, title link, "SHOP NOW" link): product.url.

  Not in the mapping list - kept as reference's own placeholder text, same
  convention as card 4's eyebrow/essential-copy:
  - compare-product-image>span (e.g. "THE CHAMPIONSHIP SUIT" label).

  Expects: product, swatch_limit (unused here - kept for a consistent
  render signature with 5dla_product-card-1/2/3/4.liquid)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
-%}

<article class="compare-product-card c5dla-card-5">
  <a class="compare-product-image" href="{{ product.url }}">
    {%- if product.featured_media -%}
      <img
        src="{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 900 }}"
        alt="{{ product.featured_media.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="900"
        height="{{ 900 | divided_by: product.featured_media.preview_image.aspect_ratio }}"
      >
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- comment -%} No label data source yet - dummy placeholder. {%- endcomment -%}
    <span>THE CHAMPIONSHIP SUIT</span>
  </a>
  <div class="compare-product-copy">
    <p>{{ product.vendor }}</p>
    <h3><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a></h3>
    <div>
      <span>{{ current_variant.price | money }}</span>
      <a href="{{ product.url }}">
        SHOP NOW
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
